{
    "attributes": {
        "action": "Introduce stricter regulation for pet cremation",
        "additional_details": "My dog Teddy\u2019s ashes went missing, after doing some investigating I uncovered an awful situation I\u2019ll never unsee but I\u2019ve also learnt how unregulated pet cremation is.\r\nThis has caused me trauma, but if any good can come out of it maybe it\u2019ll help heal me and many other owners who are going through the same thing. In Teddy\u2019s honour I\u2019d like to try get pets remains treated with more respect to prevent heart ache or loss of ashes!\r\n",
        "background": "I want stricter rules such as requiring those who carry out pet cremation to have license, compulsory inspections, mandatory identity tags on pets, storage standards, staff training and respectful handling. We also think there should be CCTV requirements covering all key areas of the crematoria.",
